<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 110 mln Dfl bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 110 mln Dfl bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK (RATED AA2/AA-)</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DFL   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    04.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.808   PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.233    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5-10	LISTING    AMST/LUX  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 15.APR.00 DSL</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST THREE YEARS, THEN STEPS UP TO 6.5 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
